cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use voicebench in your research or product evaluation, cite it as below."
title: "voicebench: a benchmark harness for real-time voice agents"
abstract: >-
  voicebench plays a scripted conversation into a real-time voice agent, records
  both sides of the call, and measures response latency, barge-in handling, false
  barge-ins, and turn-taking from the recorded audio.
type: software
authors:
  - name: "superintelligenceco contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/superintelligenceco/voicebench"
url: "https://superintelligenceco.github.io/voicebench/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-30"
keywords:
  - voice agents
  - benchmark
  - latency
  - barge-in
  - voice activity detection
